  "steps": [
    "Combine greek yogurt with the roasted besan and spices to form a marinade.",
    "Coat your paneer cubes in this and let it sit for 15 mins in the fridge.",
    "Brush some oil on a non-stick pan and saute your paneer on all sides until golden brown.",
    "For the corinader pesto, grind a cup of coriander and handful of mint with garlic, walnuts, chillies, lemon juice, olive oil, salt and pepper.",
    "Combine 1-2 tbsp of this pesto with 1 tbsp greek yogurt.",
    "Chop your cucumber into juliennes and sprinkle salt and keep aside to drain out excess water.",
    "Soak the cucumber noodles between 2 sheets if tissue paper to dry them and add it to the yogurt pesto mix.",
    "Assemble with cucumber noodles, achari tikka and toasted walnuts."
